        "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1], showing an anime-inspired close-up portrait of a young woman in soft dappled morning light.\n<Subject 1> is the young woman in <Picture 1>, with long dark hair, loose strands across her face, pale warm skin, one visible blue-gray eye, soft coral lips, and a calm, affectionate expression.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 1> (S1), providing her vocal identity, pitch, accent, warmth, pacing, and conversational delivery without copying the source recording or its spoken words.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + audio reference] The target video begins from <Picture 1> and gently animates <Subject 1> speaking directly to the viewer. Her appearance and composition remain consistent while <Audio 1> guides the voice performance of the new dialogue.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the close-up composition, facial features, hairstyle, dappled lighting, muted color palette, and anime-inspired style are retained.\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - her identity, long dark hair, visible blue-gray eye, delicate facial features, coral lips, and gentle expression remain consistent.\n<Audio 1>: reference - <Subject 1>'s voice follows the reference timbre, pitch, accent, warmth, and unhurried delivery without directly copying the source audio or its original words.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a tender, dreamlike anime-inspired portrait style with delicate linework, soft natural lighting, shallow depth of field, and a quiet intimate atmosphere. Preserve the original close-up framing, muted gray-green background, loose dark hair, bright dappled sunlight, and soft white blossoms near the right side of the frame.\n[Shot 1] The shot begins from <Picture 1>. <Subject 1> fills the frame from the upper chest upward and remains centered, with several fine strands of hair drifting across her forehead, eye, and lips. Her visible blue-gray eye looks directly into the camera, and her coral lips rest in a small, calm smile. The soft background stays out of focus while dappled morning light moves gently across her face and hair.\nThe camera makes an almost imperceptible slow push-in. A light breeze shifts a few loose strands of <Subject 1>'s hair, and she slowly blinks once without changing her identity, hairstyle, framing, or art style. <Subject 1> (S1) speaks with the voice performance guided by <Audio 1>, using a warm, intimate, unhurried delivery, and says, <d>[English] The earth is round, but the sky is blue.</d>\nAfter the sentence, <Subject 1> closes her lips into a small reassuring smile. Her visible eye softens and catches a subtle glint of reflected light while the camera holds the close-up for the final moment. Keep the frame free of subtitles, logos, watermarks, extra characters, exaggerated facial movement, and on-screen text.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet morning room tone continues throughout the shot, with a faint breeze moving through nearby leaves and flowers. Keep the referenced voice clear and prominent while the physical ambience remains soft.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
